$Header:$
This file contains the mail template for the send quota exceed notification
The following variables will be substituted:
${PRODUCTNAME}: Product name
${HOST}: AS2 server host
${PARTNER}: The name of the partner the receive quota has been exceeded
${QUOTA}: The defined quota value


[SUBJECT]
AS2 message receive quota exceeded for ${PARTNER}


[BODY]
The number of messages received from the partner ${PARTNER} has been exceeded your set up quota of ${QUOTA}. This is an information notification only, all resulting activities have to be performed manually on the AS2 server.

